  "cost": 0,
  "interpretation": "<ul data-start=\"1614\" data-end=\"1869\">\n<li data-start=\"1614\" data-end=\"1711\">\n<p data-start=\"1616\" data-end=\"1711\">The isolated organism is sensitive to [list antibiotics] and resistant to [list antibiotics].</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1712\" data-end=\"1798\">\n<p data-start=\"1714\" data-end=\"1798\">Appropriate antibiotic therapy may be guided based on this susceptibility pattern.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1799\" data-end=\"1869\">\n<p data-start=\"1801\" data-end=\"1869\">MIC values are interpreted as per latest <strong data-start=\"1842\" data-end=\"1857\">CLSI/EUCAST</strong> guidelines.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
